  step,dige:lie
  step=2,dige:lie,desc:seed a two-level rig — three cogs under the root and two grandchildren under the first
  step=3,dige:lie,desc:commission the glass nested on the rig and stir to rest
    Assertion:board-nested,sentence:the glass was commissioned nested on one rig and stood its board
    Assertion:root-tiles,sentence:the scope recursion fills the frame — the three cogs tessellate the whole root cell so the parent area equals the sum of its children
    Assertion:deep-tiles,sentence:the recursion goes deeper — the two grandchildren tessellate their parent cog cell exactly so a scope nests inside a scope
    Assertion:all-seated,sentence:every nested cell took a seat inside the frame — each child and grandchild wears a target with a real radius
  step=4,dige:lie,desc:re-commission the same tree flat — only the root is cut and the children get no target
    Assertion:nesting-load-bearing,sentence:the nesting is load-bearing — commissioned flat the same tree seats only the root and its children get no target at all
